Renia claimed the twin blades. They whispered for souls. Hanlar's assassins attacked before the party could leave.
The blades drained their victims to brittle skeletons. Renia fought with frightening delight.
Back in Hamun, Karak told the others about Grim. Renia was furious at the secret; Vera admitted she had feared the power might be dormant and dangerous.
[end_timeline]
